<title>NIGERIA: Smithkline Beecham Nigeria profit falls.</title>
<headline>Smithkline Beecham Nigeria profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month result for Smithkline Beecham Nigeria Plc to end-September 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>					1996	 1995</p>
<p>Sales</p>
<p>					2,200  vs 1,900</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	  254.3  vs 292.4</p>
<p>Taxation			     81.4  vs 103.3</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	    172.9 vs 189.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said in a statement that the cost of its recently concluded merger with Sterling Products affected profit for the period. It said it expected profit to be higher in the final year result.</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
